  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759824,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 16 BIT XMAS 2012 - Snowball Fight (Super Nintendo Entertainment System)\n\nEmbrace the frosty fun of *Snowball Fight*, a chaotic and hilarious four-player battle for winter supremacy! Inspired by classic snowball fights and brimming with holiday cheer, this RetroZone Super Nintendo game captures the spirit of playful rivalry. Gather your three best friends and prepare for a blizzard blast of icy projectiles and mischievous mayhem.\n\nGameplay revolves around strategic snowball throwing and dodging across beautifully pixelated winter landscapes. Build your arsenal by gathering snowballs scattered throughout the arena, and utilize power-ups like snow shields and icy blasts to gain the upper hand.  Each player selects a unique character, each with slightly different stats, adding a layer of strategic depth to the snowball-slinging action.  \n\nPerfect for holiday gatherings and friendly competitions, *Snowball Fight* delivers fast-paced, accessible fun for players of all ages.  Relive the joy of a snowball to the face – this time, digitally! Prepare for laughter, friendly taunts, and a whole lot of snowy chaos!"
    },
